From 4c4db8c9a424d749db2e5c4d66408991cff53afa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 13:11:17 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] dpkg: Recognize recorded Lean Code conffiles without
 restoring them

Only normalize the installed conffile digest when the owning package record matches its current bytes and the pristine original matches both the recorded SHA-256 and dpkg Conffiles MD5. Reuse this check for maintscript-helper removals and renames through a private readonly action. Keep incoming file hashes, verification and conflict decisions unchanged.

Assisted-by: gpt-6-astra via Codex
---
 src/common/actions.h           |   1 +
 src/dpkg-maintscript-helper.sh |   4 +-
 src/main/archives.c            | 159 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 src/main/configure.c           |   2 +-
 src/main/main.c                |   1 +
 src/main/main.h                |   6 ++
 src/main/unpack.c              |   3 +-
 7 files changed, 171 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

